arm64: dts: mediatek: gemini: add VCN33 supplies to the consys node

The vendored WMT platform code (modules/connectivity, tracker issue #6)
powers VCN33_BT / VCN33_WIFI through the regulator API on BT/Wi-Fi
function-on (consys_hw_bt_vcn33_ctrl / consys_hw_wifi_vcn33_ctrl); the
node so far only carried the vcn18/vcn28 supplies the CONSYS spike needed
for chip-ID. Wire the remaining two rails from the existing mt6351
regulator node so regulator_get("vcn33_bt"/"vcn33_wifi") resolves.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda.dts
@@ -1356,6 +1356,8 @@
 		clock-names = "btif";
 		vcn18-supply = <&mt6351_vcn18_reg>;
 		vcn28-supply = <&mt6351_vcn28_reg>;
+		vcn33_bt-supply = <&mt6351_vcn33_bt_reg>;
+		vcn33_wifi-supply = <&mt6351_vcn33_wifi_reg>;
 		memory-region = <&consys_mem>;
 	};
 };
